ess for a while though they  have not really had any major  breakthroughs in the field of big  Hollywood Blockbusters we are looking  forward to the final outcome Fantastic  Four we'll arrive in theaters on  November 8 2024.  about two weeks ago Disney's well-known  d23 Expo took place at the Anaheim  Convention Center those who have not had  enough of all of the information about  the MCU Pixar and more can now look  forward to the official follow-up from  Disney this week many of the projects  have now either received a release date  for the first time or the previous one  has been postponed in total around a  dozen movies are affected which we would  like to present to you in short five  films have been assigned a release date  in the following order wish on November  22nd 2023 Pixar's Elio on March 1 2024  Disney Snow White on March 22nd 2024  Pixar's Inside Out sequel on June 14  2024 and Mufasa The Lion King on July  5th 2024. some movies have merely had  their release dates adjusted the new  dates include Haunted Mansion on August  11 2023 blade on November 3rd 2023  Captain America New World Order on May  3rd 2024 Thunderbolts on July 26 2024  and Fantastic Four on November 8th and  24. the following year we'll then see  the releases of Avengers the Kang  Dynasty on May 2nd 2025 and Avengers  secret war on November 8th 2025 in close  succession another Marvel movie is also  scheduled to be released after  Thunderbolts on September 6 2024  officially kicking off phase six however  it is not known what the title will be  yet sadly the release date of Star Wars  Rogue Squadron from director Patty  Jenkins which was supposed to be  released in December of 2023 is now  uncertain due to various production  issues the theatrical release has now  been suspended for the time being all in  all there's a lot going on at Disney and  fans can now Mark a few new days in red  on their calendar apart from the absence  of the theatrical release of Star Wars  Rogue Squadron t